  m_text: "<b>Modelers</b>\n\nOleju\nReflex_Entertainment\nSimoxus\nMattOades\nApocryphos\nAtomicsneak\nBrandon
    Smith\nIvan Mikhailov (Redbull.Ivan)\nJames Bear (Moonsaber)\nKenneth Crooker\nCridone\nMicro\nNight\nProsth\nTheKMan\nReilly
    Grindle (Mirocaine)\nSaitoFox\nSam Lynch (InnocentSam)\nShaun Gaylard (ENDSHN)\nInward3D\nTom
    Malinowski\nVladislav Borisevich (\"Vane Brain\")\n\n\n\n\n<b>Spriters</b>\n\nPolyhaven\nPolligon\n3d.sk\nAnon4743\nXtrithX\nRacer_216\nPeetelsAcUtie
    \nDrKens\nJoonas Rikkonen (\"Regalis\")\nShaun Gaylard (ENDSHN)\nPavel Lvovich
    Gorfunkel\nShadowscale48\nOrgil Pount (Destructoid)\nCaleb Yu (Omniary)\n\n\n\n\n<b>Programmers</b>\n\nSimoxus\n\n\n\n\n<b>Sound
    Effects</b>\n\nSimoxus\nSonniss\nAdobe\nZero-G\nJoonas Rikkonen (\"Regalis\")\n\n\n\n\n<b>Music</b>\n\nKevin
    MacLeod\nAjoura\nAstowo\nFireFox\nVladislav Borisevich (\"Vane Brain\")\nMyuu\nAlleryPope\nJacek
    Rogal (\"Burnert\")\nDEFLORE\nTim Morrison\n\n\n\n\n<b>Voice Actors</b>\n\nAaron
    Mckee (\"TheVolgun\")\nBrendan Sussman (\"DukeLovesYou\")\nGraham Ruruku (\"Stealthy
    Zoroark\")\nHunter\nItsDuke\nJoshofsouls\nMoonstiee\nSolidBaker\nTallfellow\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<b>Special
    Thanks</b>\n\nInward3D\nXtrithX\nItzslain\nJevediah\nKuro\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<b>In
    Memoriam of Mark Sibly</b>\n\nThough you've passed onto better things, your work
    lives in every corridor, shadow, and flickering light of this remake >3\n\nThank
    you for making the shitty engine we know as Blitz3D. We wouldn't have the SCP
    community be the same without you."
